<title>USA: St Joseph Cty, Ind., won by City Securities.</title>
<headline>St Joseph Cty, Ind., won by City Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>City Securities Corp said it won $2.260 million of St. Joseph County, Ind., general obligation judgment funding bonds of 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.093 percent.</p>
</text>
